I look at different clothes in the shop.
I choose a few cotton clothes.
I take those clothes and go into the fitting room.
There are three clothes in my hand.
First, I pick up a blue kurta.
This blue kurta is very beautiful.
It is of a large size.
I put on that kurta.
This large kurta fits me exactly.
The cotton fabric is very soft.
This kurta is very good for the summer.
I look at the price on the kurta.
The price of this beautiful kurta is not high.
It is truly affordable.
I like this blue kurta a lot.
I buy this kurta.
